tarted moving around, surrounded by will-o'-the-wisps. And you could also hear whispers...",9,""],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["se","se_071"],["stage",5,1,15],["trn",0,0,true,false,0.1],["w",0.1],["bg","phoenix_street",0,0.0],["show","avg1_141","b","002",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.5],["ctl","avg1_141","b",null,"exclamation",null,null,null,1.0,"jushou2","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_141","Well! That about sums up all I know.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_141","b","016","star",null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_141","Not bad, huh? Guess you could call me a bit of an expert on everything!",0,""],["w",0.5],["bgm","m45"],["mrt",1,"z","013","speechless","chijing"],["say","avg3_100","I … I guess...==W== But just knowing the rumors won't solve anything. If it really is haunted, we'll need someone who actually knows how to catch ghosts...",1,""],["w",1.0],["mrt",0,"z","010","sigh",null],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_141","b","002","attention",null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_141","Ghost-catching's my master's specialty! You can wait for her to come out of the retreat, then ask her for help!",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","But she won't be available for another two months, right? Baize Bureau wants me to get to the bottom of this thing ASAP.",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","014","idea",null],["say","avg3_100","Come to think of it, you are a Xuan Shi, too. Can you lend me a hand?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_141","b","008","symbol",null,null,null,1.0,"chijing","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_141","Huh? Me??==W== Uh, well, my master left me a ton of homework, so I really can't.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_141","b","010","flurry",null,null,null,1.0,"niunie1","OutSine",0.5],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_141","b","002","idea",null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_141","Maybe you can ask my seniors? I don't know where they are, but they say if your heart 